    "title": "Miami man charged with motorcycle theft - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n14 hours ago\nMARATHON — A 22-year-old Miami man was arrested on Friday, Nov. 28, for allegedly stealing a motorcycle following a traffic stop on U.S. 1.\nDaniel Marquez was charged with grand theft of a motor vehicle, operating a motorcycle without an endorsement and having an expired registration, reports say.\nDeputies stopped Marquez who they say was speeding on a Ducati motorcycle at approximately 10 p.m. on Thursday, Nov. 27, in Marathon.\nThe motorcycle was listed as stolen, and Marquez gave conflicting stories as to how he acquired the motorcycle, reports say.\nMarquez was subsequently arrested. The Sarasota Police Department assisted in this case.\n1",
